    <string name="empty_title">Who would you hate to drift apart from?</string>
    <string name="empty_text">Friendships rarely end in a fight. They fade quietly: university, a new job, a move, and suddenly a year has passed without a call.\n\nAdd your parents, grandparents, a childhood friend, an old classmate. Start with three people. Ties will gently remind you when it is time to call.</string>

