    <string name="starter_title">What to talk about</string>
    <string name="starter_next">Another idea</string>
    <string-array name="starters">
        <item>Ask how studies or work are going, and really listen.</item>
        <item>Bring up a shared memory: “Today I remembered how we…”</item>
        <item>Send a photo or a song that reminded you of them.</item>
        <item>Ask for their advice. People love to feel their opinion matters.</item>
        <item>Just say you miss them. That is enough.</item>
        <item>Suggest a 10-minute call this weekend.</item>
        <item>Ask how their week went and tell them about yours.</item>
        <item>Suggest meeting up next time you are in the same city.</item>
        <item>Congratulate them on something small: an exam, a new job, a move.</item>
        <item>Ask about mutual friends: who have they seen lately?</item>
        <item>Write for no reason. You are the reason.</item>
        <item>Ask if there is anything you can help with.</item>
    </string-array>

